From 444fbe396a64ace508f86138ae814c1212d41ca8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: justsisyphus <justsisyphus@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Jan 2026 03:00:01 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 1363/5749] fix(delegate-task): use lowercase sisyphus-junior
 agent name in API calls
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Previous fix (7ed7bf5c) only updated Atlas → atlas, but missed Sisyphus-Junior.
OpenCode does case-sensitive agent lookup, causing crash when delegate_task
tried to spawn 'Sisyphus-Junior' (registered as 'sisyphus-junior').

- SISYPHUS_JUNIOR_AGENT constant: 'Sisyphus-Junior' → 'sisyphus-junior'
- agent-tool-restrictions key: 'Sisyphus-Junior' → 'sisyphus-junior'
- Updated related test mocks
---
 src/features/task-toast-manager/manager.test.ts | 12 ++++++------
 src/shared/agent-tool-restrictions.ts           |  2 +-
 src/tools/delegate-task/tools.test.ts           | 14 +++++++-------
 src/tools/delegate-task/tools.ts                |  2 +-
 4 files changed, 15 insertions(+), 15 deletions(-)

